hy and at his own pace, and doesn't break his stance as a bystander, but his real face is a dangerous person."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65715"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会長を務め、品行方正で通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校の風紀をただし、誰からも尊敬されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公はシマダのことを兄のように慕い、悩みを良く相談している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんな意見でも真剣に向き合うことで、解決しようとする、出来た人間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人の悩みを、彼なりの答えで導いていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9565","sourceWorkId":"16109","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b851a8dac1ebd20d5b6bca9546be7229d98f86efae1a0e5dd01fb232c4ad17e3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50332103ad1bcbe358204ed394f4443d956b992f11ccf92578a4dd65c4a6713e.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"機知 通","creatorId":"vndb:s35","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s35","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s35","name":"岡崎 雅紘","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79780","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c125006","characterName":"タカラ父","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c125006"},"originalCharacterName":"タカラ父","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head of the family who reigns at the top of the Takara tribe, and the commander-in-chief of the Horai Group, who is extremely busy. He's a soft-spoken gentleman, but he hides \"something\" inside him, like an immeasurable black hole."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125006"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f34cb4918ceb540d9ab58d62cee0564b6f34170c277464d4fc4578a35b58a4a9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0cbb1efabc8f3e9e68ee67f79664666058c5446b75a8fc61d89d0dddf255cfe9.webp","width":223,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いちご みるく","creatorId":"vndb:s1447","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1447","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1447","name":"白石 稔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79781","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65711","characterName":"アヅマ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65711"},"originalCharacterName":"アヅマ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"22"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man living his unchanging days with disinterest while working part-time at a convenience store. His good looks are the only thing he has going for him. He acts cheerful but internally he’s quite subdued. He has no real dreams or ambitions, but passes the long days with content. He’s a frugal sort who can be happy over something like the butcher shop he frequents putting chicken meat on sale. He’s participating in the tour after winning the trip from the lottery drawing in the shopping district."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Source official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65711"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10771645086ed32b7cfd107d7059b03d18330c18ec7e873800b84521bd9d45d4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa5fd479d2bb7bfb3bb4b4e09f633050c5876056fa5a85dc864b4c228dcc3384.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"刺草 ネトル","creatorId":"vndb:s5570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5570","name":"北山 恭祐","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79783","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65712","characterName":"ミツギ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65712"},"originalCharacterName":"ミツギ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"25"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An architectural designer. He’s a cool lone wolf type, just as he appears, but, fundamentally, his exterior is that of a sensible, common-sense man. However, it takes surprisingly little to make his anger boil over. He’s been hostile towards Azuma alone from their very first meeting for some reason. Azuma isn’t without blame either, calling Mitsugi a “blonde shithead” to his face; Whenever these two are in the same spot together, expect a fight to break out. Seems to be participating in the tour for some reason related to his work. Good with his hands."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Source: official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65712"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7327fc977b93c1807d2a71da43102578aa88f116820a17de6ba01228cea3709.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97ce09bb2ad6f73cc81efa72e58c897b1b2d4565955424e18aacab06a328630e.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一条 光","creatorId":"vndb:s755","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s755","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s755","name":"笹沼 尭羅","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79782","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65713","characterName":"マツダ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65713"},"originalCharacterName":"マツダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A salesman. Excels at taking charge of situations and good at looking after others. A manly person who will undertake a challenge even if he must play the role of the bad guy. If there’s a dispute, he’ll settle it from one step away in true Japanese fashion. He’s aware of the fact that he looks older than his age. Loves to fish. Participating in the tour because he heard of the big catches to be had fishing on the island."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Source: official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65713"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2603f2070c791d3cae85c4e2c1bc342ab3d9289f3da5da97424801d67b3c043.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46e23faf11300f1d66f91383df1f2a813b9a449cd2f7481af2fb392379ad63fb.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"テトラポット登","creatorId":"vndb:s7848","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7848","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7848","name":"古川 慎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79784","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65714","characterName":"タカラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65714"},"originalCharacterName":"タカラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A college student. He won a spot in the tour through a lottery drawing, just like Azuma. A friendly, innocent mood-maker. Due to his baby-face, Azuma actually mistook him for a middle school student at first. Because his reactions to everything are so dramatic, he tends to get teased by those around him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Source: official website profile."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His real age is 22."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65714"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/788126928d312fabde7b444c1e87b75c848279d49a53dd407e6da93817a211a1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf9ce470ba99f3b359333a391c641eec71bbb03f6e457f8ef05412bcf7f0823a.webp","width":199,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"湯町駆","creatorId":"vndb:s14761","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14761","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14761","name":"野上 翔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79786","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65716","characterName":"ホンゴウ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65716"},"originalCharacterName":"ホンゴウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"35"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The tour guide. He looks a little dark-eyed, but he's very humble and always attentive to his customers. He has a strong sense of responsibility. During the tour, he's always on the move for everyone. Since he was a student he loved to travel and finally got a job and he was hooked. His family owns a cake shop, which is run by his younger brother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65716"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95d38ce92f80f95be5fc0bd62ff79ccb5b392b854a6d27a26c8798198c56a833.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d080c692e25d85dfa121990a25c819ad017099ab5c77556878173340b71b9579.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"紫乃森 響","creatorId":"vndb:s17490","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17490","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17490","name":"紫乃森 響","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79787","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93273","characterName":"ナンジョウ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93273"},"originalCharacterName":"ナンジョウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takara's older brother. At the discretion of his father, who is the family head, when his younger brother Takara was born, he was adopted by a branch family. Therefore, he calls himself Nanjo of the branch family. Originally, he was supposed to succeed the head family as the eldest son, but he was deprived of his position by his younger brother, and he bitterly resents Takara. He gets angry easily and likes bread."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93273"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f344c80b06643246fb8d228d1f620110131e9fb2ae3422613a5c6b8e531ca26.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59125799b2be1192dc50c5a16df683e6a37c46854354544894c755e3fa7f1e5c.webp","width":199,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"冬ノ 熊肉","creatorId":"vndb:s10610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10610","name":"熊谷 健太郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79785","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p583","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1767","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p583","name":"PIL/SLASH","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:27580:1767","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7556","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7556","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7556","name":"JAST Blue","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:145515:v24660","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7556","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7556","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7556","name":"JAST Blue","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:145516:v24660","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p7556","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p7556","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p7556","name":"JAST Blue","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"sourc